        <div class="section__text">
          <p class="section__text__p1">Building <strong>agents</strong> that take repetitive work off your plate</p>
          <h1 class="title">Sukanya Sahoo</h1>
          <p class="section__text__p2">Backend Software Engineer</p>
          <p class="hero-summary">
            Entry-Level Backend Software Engineer with 2+ years of experience 
            building production systems across B2B Enterprise, FinTech, and HealthTech, 
            with systems serving 350K+ users and processing 30M+ logs per day, 
            plus 3 AI research papers including work accepted at IEEE EMBS 2025.
          </p>
          <p class="hero-highlight">
            At Hewlett Packard Enterprise, I built an AI agent platform that
            processes 30M+ database logs daily and reduced manual troubleshooting
            by over 90%. Previously, I built chatbots and voice assistants at
            Affinsys AI serving 350K+ banking users. Based in Houston, Texas.
          </p>

          <div class="btn-container">
