              <ul class="experience-bullets">
                <li class="experience-bullet">
                  Built a database intelligence platform in Python with AI agents that
                  processes 30M+ logs per day, cutting manual database troubleshooting
                  by over 90%, by automating root-cause analysis and routing every
                  corrective action through human approval.
                </li>
                <li class="experience-bullet">
                  Automated dev and test environment setup for 30+ deployments per
                  month, shrinking setup time from 3 hours to 15 minutes per deployment,
