            <article class="details-container experience-role">
              <header class="role-header">
                <div class="role-identity">
                  <h3 class="role-title">Backend Software Engineering Intern</h3>
                  <p class="role-company">Hewlett Packard Enterprise</p>
                </div>
                <div class="role-meta">
                  <time class="role-dates">May 2025 - Dec 2025</time>
                  <span class="role-location">Houston, TX</span>
                </div>
              </header>
              <ul class="experience-bullets">
                <li class="experience-bullet">
                  Established observability across 1,000+ production database clusters,
                  resulting in 60% faster detection of performance issues, by turning
                  log and query signals into alerts and stress testing slow queries in
                  SQL.
                </li>
                <li class="experience-bullet">
                  Built a RAG assistant over 20,000+ internal database runbooks for
                  HPE's database engineers, saving 30 minutes on each troubleshooting
                  lookup, by indexing the runbooks into Weaviate and grounding each
                  answer in their text.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </article>

            <div
