          <article class="details-container color-container project-card">
            <div class="project-image-wrap">
            <img
              src="./assets/project-llmbias.png"
              alt="LLM bias detection illustration"
              class="project-img"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="project-content">
            <p class="eyebrow">Responsible AI · LLM Evaluation · Explainable AI</p>

            <h3 class="experience-sub-title project-title">
              LLM Bias Detection Framework
            </h3>

            <p class="project-description">
              Developed a framework to detect subtle biases in large language model
              outputs using a custom Large Language Model Bias Index (LLMBI) and
              explainable AI techniques, providing transparent bias analysis with
              interpretable model explanations.
            </p>

            <div class="project-outcomes">
              <p class="project-outcomes-title">Impact</p>
              <ul>
                <li class="project-outcome">
                  Tested <strong>60 model outputs across 6 demographic bias categories</strong>,
                  flagging bias signals in <strong>over 80% of intentionally biased
                  samples</strong> and generating SHAP/LIME explanations to identify the
                  language driving each prediction.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="tag-list">
              <span>Responsible AI</span>
              <span>Explainable AI</span>
              <span>LLMs</span>
              <span>LIME</span>
              <span>SHAP</span>
